  "description": "Crown roast of pork is both elegant and easy, making it a perfect entrée for your next dinner party.",
  "notes": "Total time, including resting: 2 hr 45 min.\n\nNotes: Ask your butcher for your crown roast at least a day or two in advance to make sure they can order it and prepare it. Aim for around one and a half chops per person, or two chops per person if you want leftovers.\nOther aromatics, like minced garlic or chopped herbs, can be added along with the salt and pepper if desired.\nTo prevent the ends of the ribs from burning, cap each with a piece of aluminum foil.",
